<LegalLayout title="About us" eyebrow="BookMojo Studio" description="We make personalised storybooks in which every child gets to lead the adventure.">
  <h2>Our work</h2>
  <p>BookMojo Studio creates made-to-order storybooks using a child’s name, age, language, appearance and chosen story world. Families approve the personalised preview before a printed book enters production.</p>

  <h2>Where we are</h2>
  <p>BookMojo Studio is based in Narnaul, Haryana 123001. We serve families across India, with delivery available to more than 19,000 PIN codes.</p>

  <h2>Original stories</h2>
  <p>Our illustrations and manuscripts are original works developed for BookMojo. We aim to make every story age-appropriate, inclusive and joyful to read aloud.</p>

  <h2>Talk to us</h2>
  <p>Questions, partnerships and order support can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@bookmojo.in">hello@bookmojo.in</a>.</p>
